*.csproj.user
*.sln.DotSettings.user
# Unity regenerates these from the .asmdef layout on every editor run, so they
# turned up modified in literally every commit. HabagatSim.Verify.csproj is NOT
# one of them — it is hand-written, and it is what links the simulation sources
# into the dotnet fingerprint harness.
unity/HabagatUnity/*.csproj
unity/HabagatUnity/*.sln
